{"recordId":"minister_鄭俠_2004337453","name":"鄭俠","type":"minister","dynasty":"北宋","title":"監門直臣","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"鄭俠","pageId":1456924,"revisionId":94493495,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-22T07:56:18Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%84%AD%E4%BF%A0","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94493495","wikidataId":"Q15938456","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"鄭俠","url":"https://www.zgbk.com/ecph/words?SiteID=1&ID=2HnozI","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite encyclopedia","author":"","publisher":"","date":"","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"中国大百科全书","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"西塘集","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"续资治通鉴","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"西塘集 (四庫全書本)","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E8%A5%BF%E5%A1%98%E9%9B%86_(%E5%9B%9B%E5%BA%AB%E5%85%A8%E6%9B%B8%E6%9C%AC)","origin":"sister-template","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:05.782Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:songshi","source:mingshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:songshi-535754da96a96b74","query":"鄭俠","count":1,"offset":11638,"excerpt":"》六卷\n\n又《詩》三卷《呂陶集》六十卷《張舜民集》一百卷《張商英集》十三卷\n\n《鄭俠集》二十卷錢惟演《伊川集》五卷《陳簡能集》一卷馮京《潛山文集》一卷\n\n《陳舜俞集》三十卷又《治說》十卷《應製策論》一卷《金君卿集》十卷\n\n劉煇《東歸集》十卷《王","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-bcd347381eee2758","query":"鄭俠","count":1,"offset":5211,"excerpt":"如常儀，人賴以安，猶坐貶監潭州稅。\n\n熙寧中，為開封、度支二判官，遷鹽鐵副使。時鄭俠以上書竄嶺表，克臣嘗薦俠，且饋之白金，又坐奪官。復為戶部副使，以集賢殿修撰知鄆州。京東多盜，克臣請以便宜處決，遂下諸郡使械送尤桀者斬以徇，盜為少衰。河決曹村，克","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-d8d0d3a2a39daa14","query":"鄭俠","count":1,"offset":2414,"excerpt":"政事。數與安石論辨，又薦劉分攵、蘇軾掌外製。安石令保甲養馬，京謂必不可行。會選人鄭俠上書言時政，薦京可相，呂惠卿因是譖京與俠通，罷知亳州。未幾，以資政殿學士知渭州。茂州夷叛，徙知成都府。蕃部何丹方寇雞粽關，聞京兵至，請降。議者遂欲盪其巢窟，京請","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-7952ad50b4d978b0","query":"鄭俠","count":3,"offset":2033,"excerpt":"神宗顧之甚厚，嘗訪人材之可用者。襄以司馬光、韓維、呂公著、蘇頌、范純仁、蘇軾至於鄭俠三十三人對，謂光、維、公著皆股肱心膂之臣，不當久外；謂俠愚直敢言，發於忠義，投竄瘴癘，朝不謀夕，願使得生還。帝不能盡用。\n\n錢公輔\n\n錢公輔，字君倚，常州武進人","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-77d9ed4d734987cf","query":"鄭俠","count":3,"offset":3775,"excerpt":"臣亦聞之。」安石曰：「士大夫不逞者以京為歸，故京獨聞其言，臣未之聞也。」監安上門鄭俠上疏，繪所見流民扶老攜幼困苦之狀，為圖以獻，曰：「旱由安石所致。去安石，天必雨。」俠又坐竄嶺南。慈聖、宣仁二太后流涕謂帝曰：「安石亂天下。」帝亦疑之，遂罷為觀文","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-3d28f6c9be45225c","query":"鄭俠","count":1,"offset":4312,"excerpt":"言：「行役法以來，最下戶亦每歲納錢，乞度寬羨數均損之，以惠貧弱。」後皆施行。\n\n鄭俠事起，璪媚呂惠卿，劾馮京與俠交通有跡，深其辭，致京等於罪。判司農寺，出知河陽。元豐初，入權度支副使，遂知制誥、知諫院。判國子監，薦蔡卞可為直講。建增博士弟子員，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-de27908511672213","query":"鄭俠","count":1,"offset":4192,"excerpt":"當國，聞而異之，御史張商英亦稱其材，用爲審官院主簿。使熙河括田，有績，遷奉禮郎。鄭俠既貶，復被逮，亶承命往捕，遇諸陳。搜俠篋，得所録名臣諫草，有言新法事及親朋書尺，悉按姓名治之，竄俠嶺南，馮京、王安國諸人皆得罪。擢亶太子中允、提舉兩浙常平。\n\n","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-04384c541a306c8f","query":"鄭俠","count":1,"offset":3010,"excerpt":"正中書戶房事。神宗覽其文，除集賢校理、直舍人院，改知諫院、知制誥。同鄧綰、張琥治鄭俠獄，深致其文，入馮京、王安國、丁諷、王堯臣罪。\n\n擢御史中丞。上疏曰：「向者陛下登用雋賢，更易百度，士狃於見聞，蔽於俗學，競起而萃非之，故陛下排斥異論，以圖治功","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:songshi-c22bf482e77c8a13","query":"鄭俠","count":1,"offset":5132,"excerpt":"充賞，民不勝其困。又因保甲正長給散靑苗，使結甲赴官，不遺一人，上下騷動。\n\n　　鄭俠疎惠卿朋姦壅蔽，惠卿怒，又惡馮京異己，而安石弟安國惡惠卿姦諂，面辱之。於是乘勢並陷三人，皆獲罪。安石以安國之故，始有隙。惠卿既叛安石，凡可以害王氏者無不爲。韓絳","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-c6f0328ef16915a2","query":"鄭俠","count":1,"offset":2238,"excerpt":"？今天下民窮財殫，所在饑饉，山、陜、河南，婦子仳離，僵仆滿道，疾苦危急之狀，蓋有鄭俠所不能圖者，陛下不得聞且見也。邇者雷擊日壇，星墜如鬥，天變示儆於上；畿輦之間，子弒父，仆殺主，人情乖離於下。庶以為海內盡無可言已乎？夫在廷之臣，其為言官者十僅二","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":10,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:songshi-535754da96a96b74","bookId":"book:songshi","requestedTitle":"宋史/卷208","title":"宋史/卷208","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7208","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2632044","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7208?action=history","revisionId":2632044,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-12-14T13:34:38Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:05.802Z","sha256":"95e837054632016085aaffa65d1b241c43d5bb6232049c93c92f0ddf62f7b776","textSha256":"b62389c0e4c9fa63ce10a902987cc3df046a8f648a2d576aff68fbcbd74fd120","expandedWikitextSha256":"95e837054632016085aaffa65d1b241c43d5bb6232049c93c92f0ddf62f7b776","characters":17216,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/songshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:43.314Z","upstreamTextQuality":25,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 25% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/9fd7625e9dc6a417fafa.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/9fd7625e9dc6a417fafa.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:songshi-bcd347381eee2758","bookId":"book:songshi","r